{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Into the house of Pharaoh</b> — two times in the Masorah: here and the other: \"the plague of locusts [came] into the house of Pharaoh.\" Because he did not acknowledge the good that Joseph did for him, and brought all the money into his house — therefore the locusts came first \"into the house of Pharaoh.\" Another interpretation: just as money is brought room within room, so the locusts came into Pharaoh's chamber, which was a room within a room." "<b>Into the house</b> — Targum: לבית."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:30.223742802Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}